      "english": "To steal a glance at someone's profile.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33478_nusumimiru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{隣|となり}→隣：01003_tonari⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{答案|とうあん}→答案：03451_touan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{盗|ぬす}み{見|み}た。",
      "english": "He peeked at the answer sheet of the person next to him.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33478_nusumimiru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼女|かのじょ}→彼女：01286_kanojo⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{本|ほん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{読|よ}む→読む：00426_yomu⟧ふり⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧し⟦ながら→ながら：10530_nagara⟧、⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{方|ほう}→方：01139_hou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{盗|ぬす}み{見|み}て⟦いた→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "She pretended to read while stealing glances at him.",
