  ],
  "notes": "⟦{盗|ぬす}む→盗む：01166_nusumu⟧ (to steal) + ⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧ (to look). Conjugates like ⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- 〜⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{盗|ぬす}み{見|み}る: to sneak a look at someone's face\n- ⟦{手帳|てちょう}→手帳：04537_techou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{盗|ぬす}み{見|み}る: to peek at someone's notebook\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{覗|のぞ}く→覗く：02388_nozoku⟧: to peek, through a gap or into something\n- ⟦{垣間見|かいまみ}る→垣間見る：09909_kaimamiru⟧: to catch a glimpse of",
